<newsitem itemid="181129" id="root" date="1996-11-11" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: HK September merchandise trade figures.</title>
<headline>HK September merchandise trade figures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following figures for merchandise trade (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars and year-on-year percentage change) (*** denotes less than 0.05 percent)</p>
<p>					 Sept 1996	   August 1996</p>
<p>Re-exports to five main destinations</p>
<p> China				 33.07 (- 0.2)    34.41 (+ 7.4)</p>
<p> U.S.				  26.46 (+10.5)    25.22 (+ 9.4)</p>
<p> Japan				  7.51 (- 1.7)     7.32 (+12.7)</p>
<p> Germany				4.15 (- 0.3)     3.44 (+ 5.5)</p>
<p> U.K.				   3.86 (+15.6)     4.38 (+ 4.0)</p>
<p>					 Sept 1996	   August 1996</p>
<p>Domestic exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				  5.15 (- 9.7)    5.29 (- 4.9)</p>
<p> U.S.				   5.14 (-19.8)    4.70 (-15.2)</p>
<p> Japan				  0.87 (- 7.4)    0.96 (- 8.5)</p>
<p>Germany				 0.87 (- 2.1)    1.01 (- 5.8)</p>
<p> U.K.				   0.96 (- 8.0)    0.98 (- 9.6)</p>
<p>					 Sept 1996	   August 1996</p>
<p>Imports from the five main suppliers</p>
<p> China				 53.12 (+ 1.9)    54.03 (+ 9.0)</p>
<p> Japan				 17.33 (- 8.2)    16.09 (-13.0)</p>
<p> Taiwan				 9.91 (- 4.9)    10.08 (- 7.9)</p>
<p> U.S.				   9.33 (- 3.6)    10.81 (+ 9.5)</p>
<p> Singapore			    6.57 (+ 0.9)     6.30 (-21.8)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
